@startuml
title Test #15: 链式 literal → $r0 → $r1 → public

object "Before\nstate (all unset)" as sb {
  literal: 'chain'
  $r0     = <unset>
  $r1     = <unset>
  publicStore: final_output = <unset>
}

object "After" as sa {
  $r0     = "chain"
  $r1     = "chain"
  publicStore: final_output = "chain"
}

sb ..> sa : 3 × executeMove\n  ① literal→$r0\n  ② $r0→$r1\n  ③ $r1→public

note right of sa
  **验证（三处终点全部一致）**
  internalStore.get('$r0')
    === 'chain' ✓
  internalStore.get('$r1')
    === 'chain' ✓
  publicStore.get('final_output')
    === 'chain' ✓
end note

@enduml
